4-tooting-bec-group-1949.jpg","caption":"Below: A Belgrave group at Tooting Bec track on 14 August 1949, with Stan Davies, sitting, second from the left. Left to right, back row: Alan Sexton, Len Adams, Tom Morrell, Archie Bedford, Johnny Morrison ?, --, --, --, Doug Briggs, --, --, George Isaacs. Front row: --, Stan Davies, J.Lacey ?, George Stace, Ron Mitchell. If anyone can confirm the names or fill in any of the blanks we'd most be pleased to hear from you.","source":"B230-38","when":"June 2003"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Alan Sexton in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1960–2003: 62 mentions in 29 issues, 34 race results and 1 photograph.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B230/B230-p24-tooting-bec-group-1949.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-alan-sexton.html"},"legend":false}